<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-GERMAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GERMAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Bundesliga matches</p>
<p>played on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Borussia Dortmund 3 (Riedle 8th minute, Heinrich 29th,</p>
<p>Tretschok 77th) Freiburg 1 (Decheiver 51st penalty). Halftime</p>
<p>2-0. Attendance 48,800.</p>
<p>Hamburg 0 VfB Stuttgart 4 (Balakov 29th, Bobic 47th and 60th,</p>
<p>Hagner 85th). 0-1. 31,139.</p>
<p>Werder Bremen 1 (Schulz 31st) Borussia Moenchengladbach 0. 1-0.</p>
<p>24,800.</p>
<p>Schalke 1 (Thon 2nd) Bochum 1 (Donkow 86th). 1-0. 33,230.</p>
